Recommends: asusctl, cardwire, pkexec
Description: G-Helper style control centre for ASUS laptops
 A compact GTK4/libadwaita front end for asusd and cardwire. It provides
 performance profiles, custom fan curves, power limits, GPU modes, firmware
 GPU switches, panel overdrive, refresh-rate control and battery charge
 limits for ASUS laptops.
